    <string name="help_bullet_3">crossed an ICES area boundary while fishing</string>
    <string name="help_create_within">You need to create your catch record within 24 hours of landing your catch.</string>
    <string name="help_special_cases">Special cases: ICES areas</string>
    <string name="help_special_cases_body">If you fish in or cross ICES areas 4c, 7d or 7e, you must create a separate catch record each time you cross a boundary.\n\nIf you need to record catches without an internet connection, use the mobile app.</string>
    <string name="help_get_help">Get help with your record</string>
    <string name="help_get_help_body">Call 0300 020 3788, Monday to Friday, 8am to 6pm.\n\nCalls to 03 numbers cost the same as calls to 01 or 02 numbers.\n\nOutside these hours, leave a catch record on our automated line.</string>
